    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "what do you mean by \"letting go of the fight\"? it just sounds so peaceful when you put it that way. like, if the debt is finally settled and i don't have to keep pretending to be okay anymore. like i could finally just stop being a burden to everyone.",
